{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay the Q is a Balatro-inspired roguelike deck builder about summoning powerful creatures and defeating enemy encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/extras/1a5b7fd5e80cb9c3efbfdcc4e718e5ed.avif?t=1770817665\" width=830 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your cards with magical Runes and combine them with unique Artifacts to build powerful synergies. Defeat enemy creatures to win rewards. Gather a small but unstoppable team or build a whole army and defeat boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/extras/ab60f4a71000c51bf75175372dd31db6.avif?t=1770817665\" width=830 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Card, Rune and Artifact can alter your run, making a difference between a win and a loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hundreds of powerful Artifacts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dozens of Runes that strenghten Cards, enchance Elements, or provide one-time effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Decks with unique modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 50 different Encounters with distinct effects and rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/extras/8295aef3583140d85d99c8aad94b6950.avif?t=1770817665\" width=830 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the hand-crafter pixel art world of magic and summon variety of creatures. Win Gold and spend it in the Shop to power up your deck. Use Compendium to plan best builds. Analyse your stats and improve your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Music in trailer and game by Eric Matyas</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102770?t=1770817665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102770?t=1770817665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/50bdc11cffc2600b37cf4220bea04ebbc4c23af9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770817665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/50bdc11cffc2600b37cf4220bea04ebbc4c23af9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770817665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay the Q is a Balatro-inspired roguelike deck builder about summoning powerful creatures and defeating enemy encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/extras/1a5b7fd5e80cb9c3efbfdcc4e718e5ed.avif?t=1770817665\" width=830 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your cards with magical Runes and combine them with unique Artifacts to build powerful synergies. Defeat enemy creatures to win rewards. Gather a small but unstoppable team or build a whole army and defeat boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/extras/ab60f4a71000c51bf75175372dd31db6.avif?t=1770817665\" width=830 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Card, Rune and Artifact can alter your run, making a difference between a win and a loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hundreds of powerful Artifacts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dozens of Runes that strenghten Cards, enchance Elements, or provide one-time effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Decks with unique modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 50 different Encounters with distinct effects and rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/extras/8295aef3583140d85d99c8aad94b6950.avif?t=1770817665\" width=830 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the hand-crafter pixel art world of magic and summon variety of creatures. Win Gold and spend it in the Shop to power up your deck. Use Compendium to plan best builds. Analyse your stats and improve your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Music in trailer and game by Eric Matyas</p>","developers":["Mana Orb"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102770/b72bba27ddb61503b9e9b5e5946a3776752ef401/header.jpg?t=1770817665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4102770/206887382/a3618e6762741a63d9a1ba80fcca79dc11f8617f/1770817077/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770817664","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4102770/206887382/a3618e6762741a63d9a1ba80fcca79dc11f8617f/1770817077/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770817664","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vid